WEBVTT

00:05:57.695 --> 00:06:02.899
The secret to economic development
is in nature's best resource:

00:06:03.860 --> 00:06:08.784
skilled, healthy
and productive human beings.

00:06:10.681 --> 00:06:15.209
The secret to changing our country
lay in enhancing and supporting

00:06:15.233 --> 00:06:18.834
the limitless potential
of the next generation

00:06:18.858 --> 00:06:21.777
and challenging them
to change our country.

00:06:22.820 --> 00:06:27.740
Human capital development
was the key to national development

00:06:27.764 --> 00:06:28.999
in Sierra Leone.

00:06:29.509 --> 00:06:30.733
As a candidate,